{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-hg.12.1:000051:note_appended:bob-cli-hg.12.1:6ad078bbd773cd8b7a312bba10959f203ff84ad1f91f113da458b01f0f54b414","timestamp":"2026-11-06T21:28:33Z","actor":"bob-cli-hg.12.1.land","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-hg.12.1","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"Landing verified all six phases (2a37f8ce, ee05db4d, b6a96243, 8935148f, 57af3ead, ae624e27) against plan:202611/gmail_compose.md and parent 5.12: new/reply/reply-all with Notes-excluding source regions; conservative pulldown-cmark render with 10 typed refusals and flattened links; private 0700/0600 attachment and body staging; drafts create/update/get with --gmail-no-send plus exact allowlists, --reply-to-message-id threading verified on readback, in-memory MIME readback, versioned canonical digest; durable gmail_send state with draft-id-only drafts send and three-outcome recovery; TTY/non-TTY confirmation, in-place promotion, Reply removal, [!mail-sent] cards, idempotent body-free gmail.sent. No memory edits; DECISIONS honored. Landing fixes: removed the five intermediate module-wide #[allow(dead_code)] allowances in compose/mod.rs plus the now-consumed GmailConfig::signature allowance, resolving the 5 dead items they hid (attachments _dir field + test-only dir(), RenderRefusal kind()/line() removed, dispatch_once cfg(test), SendState::is_terminal removed). Closed acceptance-test gaps the compose-docs audit overstated: unit test canonical_digest_is_stable_and_binds_every_preview_field (every field incl. HTML-only, Bcc, signature, attachments, note) and CLI test html_only_and_remote_draft_edits_invalidate_confirmation (HTML-only edit -> confirmation_mismatch; Gmail-side draft edit -> draft_remote_conflict with no update/send); extended the promotion test to prove list indexes and save refreshes the promoted note in place. Integration with concurrent hg.7/hg.8/hg.14/hg.10: compose notes stay out of the saved-thread index until promotion; removed stale 'Dedicated task linking remains later work' from docs/gmail.md; added new/reply/draft/send to docs/reference/json-outputs.md (within its 6000-word cap) and linked compose JSON from gmail.md#json-output. Gates: just check rc=0; just docs-check all gates passed (447 passed, 1 skipped). Follow-ups: hg.12.1.1/.2/.3 README snapshot proposals -> already fixed by b6a96243 rebaseline, recorded as note on bob-cli-hs (no new task); hg.12.1.6 complete_themes flake -> +1 on bob-cli-g8 (same test, same 150 ms deadline root cause); stale 'coming in bob-mail' line in docs/guides/link-emails-to-tasks.md and other phases' stale gmail allowances -> DISCOVERED ISSUE note on active parent epic bob-cli-hg (caused by hg.8/hg.10 ordering, not this epic). epic-symbols: none."}}
